# The ruleset "protect-main" enforces code-owner review on the default branch.
# @sevn-one is a second code owner (a user account). GitHub Apps cannot be named
# in CODEOWNERS, so an App's APPROVE (mergecraft-approve.yml, dispatched by a
# maintainer) does not satisfy code-owner review.
