# Both owners MUST stay on one line: CODEOWNERS resolves each file to only
# its LAST matching pattern, so two separate `*` lines (as briefly landed
# directly on main in 9ddd546) silently drop every owner but the last one —
# `* @sevn-one` alone, with @alexhawat dropped as a code owner entirely.
